{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":219600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5212.54096,"text":"Однако после потери калитки капитана Индия..."},{"kind":"text","t":5426.124098,"text":"However, after the loss of Captain India's gate..."},{"kind":"audio","t":5481.139055000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":5482.638385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":5483.591824,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":10633.676539,"text":"Совершила лишь 36 пробегов, потеряв 7 калиток для завершения."},{"kind":"text","t":10909.929628,"text":"It made only 36 runs, losing 7 gates to completion."},{"kind":"audio","t":10964.295262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10965.477366000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10967.131559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10968.130930000001,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":13083.061737,"text":"и нинксов."},{"kind":"text","t":13188.691083,"text":"and nixes."},{"kind":"audio","t":13237.848842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":13238.115058000001,"samples":6832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22109.284669,"text":"В них обычно предлагается особая еда, напитки и развлечения, чтобы гости оставались в хорошем настроении и не покидали заведение."},{"kind":"text","t":22552.550799,"text":"They usually offer special food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests in a good mood and prevent them from leaving the establishment."},{"kind":"audio","t":22613.590837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22615.110687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22616.689849000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22618.368493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22619.910184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22621.626499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22622.749421,"samples":27792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":33400.225222,"text":"Дальпотр имел раннее преимущество во втором сете, но это также потребовало тайпбрейка после достижения..."},{"kind":"text","t":33799.478786,"text":"Dalpotr had an early advantage in the second set, but it also required a tiebreak after reaching..."},{"kind":"audio","t":33848.309968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":33849.768458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33851.34874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33853.044394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33854.720477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":33854.895991,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42562.313167,"text":"Интернет сочетает в себе элементы как массовых, так и межличностных коммуникаций."},{"kind":"text","t":42792.090881000004,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42847.011556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42848.502306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42850.122228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42851.781132000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":42851.965345,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54634.640213,"text":"Во время сравнения при помощи инфракрасной фурье-спектроскопии выяснилось, что состав этих кристаллов соответствует кристаллам, найденным в моче пораженных домашних животных."},{"kind":"text","t":55100.721152,"text":"Comparison using Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy revealed that the composition of these crystals corresponds to the crystals found in the urine of affected pets."},{"kind":"audio","t":55166.644869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55168.22397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55169.853773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55171.464026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55173.17271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55174.787432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55176.485427,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55178.199901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55179.511488000004,"samples":28256,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":68983.454162,"text":"На некоторых маршрутов у более крупных компаний есть свои собственные самолеты, но для других маршрутов и более мелких компаний с этим была проблема."},{"kind":"text","t":69452.854337,"text":"Some of the larger companies have their own aircraft on certain routes, but for other routes and smaller companies, this was a problem."},{"kind":"audio","t":69514.60722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69516.166501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69517.832265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69519.436107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69521.134701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69522.820995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69523.749524,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":78911.671164,"text":"Некоторые атомы имеют нестабильное ядро, что означает, что они склонны распадаться при малом воздействии или без него."},{"kind":"text","t":79304.282394,"text":"Some atoms have an unstable nucleus, which means they are prone to decay with little or no external influence."},{"kind":"audio","t":79353.695558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79355.26503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":79356.879412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79358.574166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79360.22572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79361.601047,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":84461.272926,"text":"В том же месяце другой авиалайнер выкатился за пределы взлетной полосы."},{"kind":"text","t":84705.138483,"text":"In the same month, another airliner overran the runway."},{"kind":"audio","t":84756.346594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":84757.859624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":84759.538268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":84759.776203,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":89338.515259,"text":"Меш Хеди и врезался в стену. Погибли 17 человек."},{"kind":"text","t":89516.446629,"text":"Mesh Hedi crashed into a wall. 17 people died."},{"kind":"audio","t":89567.937925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89569.227781,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"audio","t":89599.691714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89600.548452,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":97418.688493,"text":"Почти все эти пляжи песчаные с безопасным купанием, и многие из них тенистые благодаря таким деревьям, как Пахутукапа."},{"kind":"text","t":97897.785843,"text":"Almost all of these beaches are sandy with safe swimming, and many of them are shaded by trees such as the Pahutukapa."},{"kind":"audio","t":97957.22751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97958.681909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97960.283001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":97961.967135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97963.608368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97965.22416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":97965.737291,"samples":1392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":110790.894958,"text":"В популярные виды спорта входят футбол, баскетбол, волейбол, водное поло, фехтование, регби, велоспорт, хоккей на льду, хоккей на роликах и автогонки формула 1."},{"kind":"text","t":111325.395013,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":111390.124656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111391.641346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111393.262879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111395.018684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111396.542105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111398.364291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111399.963284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111401.449204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":111401.568866,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116943.235839,"text":"В теплом климате Ближнего Востока дом не имел особого значения."},{"kind":"text","t":117239.210775,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the home held little significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":117293.786893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117295.384045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":117297.043008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117298.13386,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":127766.178844,"text":"Архипелаг располагается в 120 километрах от полуострова. Крупнейший остров носит имя короля Георга с поселением Вилье-Лас-Эстрельес."},{"kind":"text","t":128177.687135,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 kilometers from the peninsula. The largest island is named after King George and includes the settlement of Ville-les-Étoiles."},{"kind":"audio","t":128234.73031300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128236.663732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128238.301115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128240.011509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":128240.239454,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":128274.987373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128276.747728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128278.32924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128280.032944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128281.642137,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":138484.487444,"text":"Капустный сок меняет цвет в зависимости от того, насколько кислотным или щелочным является химическое вещество."},{"kind":"text","t":138796.096555,"text":"Cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic or alkaline a chemical substance is."},{"kind":"audio","t":138852.610502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138855.05711099997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138856.648483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138858.32954699997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138859.68252399997,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":154197.57599299998,"text":"Согласно плану, мост полностью войдет в эксплуатацию в сентябре 2017 года, когда бразильские пункты таможенной проверки, как ожидается,"},{"kind":"text","t":154667.382667,"text":"According to the plan, the bridge will become fully operational in September 2017, when Brazilian customs checkpoints are expected to"},{"kind":"audio","t":154731.90505499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154733.24982199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154734.94184599997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154736.605109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154738.212122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154739.86108499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":154741.525408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154741.705642,"samples":18424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":154808.790342,"text":"будут завершены."},{"kind":"text","t":154908.058799,"text":"be completed."},{"kind":"audio","t":154956.11618699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":154956.26916,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164312.180745,"text":"Влага на наших руках вступит в реакцию с верхним слоем, что будет необычно, затем сформируется подобие оболочки."},{"kind":"text","t":164772.715102,"text":"Moisture on our hands will react with the top layer, which will be unusual, and then a sort of shell will form."},{"kind":"audio","t":164831.25376999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164832.87186299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164834.397803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164836.05186699997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":164837.73964999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164838.660629,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":171849.01659599997,"text":"Одна из бомб взорвалась возле офиса генерал-губернатора."},{"kind":"text","t":172118.94140699998,"text":"One of the bombs exploded near the governor-general's office."},{"kind":"audio","t":172174.94552399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":172180.022176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172185.71729099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":172185.983446,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":178858.35519099998,"text":"Султан Марокко перестроил город под названием Эддар-эль-Бейда."},{"kind":"text","t":179163.35050899998,"text":"The Sultan of Morocco rebuilt a city called Ed-dar el-Beida."},{"kind":"audio","t":179218.652052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179220.23471299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179221.877957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":179222.358316,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":183959.26345499998,"text":"А испанские торговцы, создавшие тут торговые базы, назвали его Касабланка."},{"kind":"text","t":184246.290071,"text":"And the Spanish merchants, who established trading posts here, called it Casablanca."},{"kind":"audio","t":184303.30269799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184304.772417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184306.277618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184307.976982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":184308.111725,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":196280.280656,"text":"Его приветствовал заместитель премьер-министра Сингапура Вонг Кан Сенг. Затем он обсудил вопросы торговли и терроризма с премьер-министром Сингапура Ли Сянь Луном."},{"kind":"text","t":196621.562973,"text":"He was welcomed by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan Seng. He then discussed trade and terrorism issues with Singaporean Prime Minister Lee Hsien Loong."},{"kind":"audio","t":196665.15349099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196667.06180899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196668.60846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196669.60713,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"audio","t":196706.184426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196707.762768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":196709.35603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196711.007773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196712.52098399997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"audio","t":196712.622756,"samples":560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207969.297849,"text":"Атомная бомба работает на том принципе, что для того, чтобы много протонов и нейтронов находились в одном ядре, необходима энергия."},{"kind":"text","t":208394.626788,"text":"An atomic bomb works on the principle that energy is required for many protons and neutrons to remain within a single nucleus."},{"kind":"audio","t":208457.43944199997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208459.075525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":208460.74734899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208462.45007299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208464.062595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208465.723199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208466.73056899998,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":217887.14444399998,"text":"Исследуя архипелаги или посещая озёра, вы вполне сможете обойтись и без яхты."},{"kind":"text","t":218232.085305,"text":"Whether exploring archipelagos or visiting lakes, you can easily get by without a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":218289.216464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218290.75936499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218292.377858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218294.051372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218295.25150599997,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"close","t":229605.291244,"code":1005}]}